      "value": "@{68098a4626271974ef4d2775|full_name} why? i only used it to help me lay out the idea in an easy to read format as well as help streamline the main feature ideas. other than that the main concept is entirely my idea. i just deal with a lot of learning difficulties such as Dyslexia so needed help making it easier to understand is all. i dont see why the original prompt is needed  here when the whole point is that we need some sort of communication system. i use AI as a tool like how its supposed to be used rather than getting it to do EVERYTHING for me. \n\ni spent a solid hour or more working out the details and then getting GoogleAI to help format it into an easy to read list. thats all. i started by simply asking why VR Chat didn't already have a system in place for this and then argued the points it gave me and worked out a solution for them. after that it was simply down to getting GoogleAI to lay it out in a way it was easy to read for everyone cause what i wrote was a big block of text much like your seeing now. if you really want proof then images are attached of the original conversation. \n\n(Cant add all the images in this message cause i hit the cap so will post more in a separate message",
